{
 "system": "adaptintake_v2",
 "transcript": [
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hello, I'm here to help you get ready for your appointment. Could you tell me what has been bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Burning when I pass urine."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Could you tell me when you first noticed the burning and how it came on, and also whether you have any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It started four days ago."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How much is the burning affecting you day to day, and what medicines do you take, including any you’ve started or changed recently?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "The stinging is about five out of ten."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Could you tell me a bit about your health history — any ongoing health problems, past illnesses, surgeries, or times you stayed in hospital?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I had a water infection about a year ago."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Have you ever had a bad reaction or allergy to any medicine, or are you not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Yes, trimethoprim gave me an itchy rash."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Along with the burning when you pass urine, have you noticed anything else going on at the same time?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My urine looks cloudy."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Are you taking any medicines at the moment, either regularly or just recently — for example tablets, creams, or anything from the pharmacy?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I take levothyroxine each morning."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything you’ve noticed that makes the burning when you pass urine better or worse?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, I haven't noticed anything."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Since this started, is the burning there every time you pass urine, or does it come and go?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It's there whenever I go."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Apart from the water infection about a year ago, are there any other health conditions you see a doctor or nurse about regularly?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My thyroid is underactive."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Since this started, have you noticed any changes in your appetite, sleep, weight, or energy?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I'm getting up three or four times at night now."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides the levothyroxine you take every morning, is there anything else you take for your thyroid, for the water infection you mentioned, or for any other reason?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I take alendronic acid once a week."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What would you most like us to help you with at this visit?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I think it's another water infection."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Aside from the thyroid condition your levothyroxine is for and whatever you take alendronic acid for, is there anything else in your past health — like other long-term conditions, operations, or hospital stays — that we should know about?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, I don't think there's anything else."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides those, do you take any other medicines at different times of the day, use anything that isn’t a tablet — like an inhaler, eye drops, cream, injection or patch — or take anything you buy without a prescription, such as painkillers, vitamins or herbal remedies? It’s fine to say no."
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I use a cream from the hospital twice a week."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Since this started, have you noticed any other changes, like in your bladder or bowel habits, or in your breathing? It’s fine if not."
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I'm going about every hour in the day."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Where exactly do you feel the burning?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "When I pass water."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, that is very helpful. I have put together a short summary of what you told me. Please read it and tell me if anything should be corrected before it goes to your doctor."
  }
 ],
